{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week4-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week4-assignmentmd#b0046", "block": 46, "kind": "quote", "translate": true, "chars": 125, "sha256": "7279f375d2cd8d1e", "text": "*Tips: Use checklists/scratchpads, reset context (`/clear`) between roles, and run agents in parallel for independent tasks.*"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week4-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week4-assignmentmd#b0047", "block": 47, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 37, "sha256": "dba5c5bb70a7e75f", "text": "Part II: Put Your Automations to Work"}
